      "note": "Both say `<ACR>` but neither states the acronym must be short/collision-safe (`^[A-Z][A-Z0-9]*-REQ-[0-9]+$`). I used `TOKEN-NORMALIZE-REQ-1`, which only the first check flagged (call_00_QvDNyIpnybT6N1yoLmO54711), forcing a second whole Write (call_00_ppqQXnF7XT5OBzbdJEKB1251) and second check (call_00_xJkLEeATrGzWUnnbcDJG5767).",
