      "note": "The skeleton was read before the format files, yet MODULE_REQUIREMENTS format is only defined elsewhere; the directive says read formats only from section comments, but the skeleton comments do not name requirement-entry-format at all, so it was found by listing formats (call_00_o8WHg7lCDs7XAyhW4cg71602).",
