    "Whether the second check's warning resolution is accepted as semantic adequacy; only terminal 'clean' was observed, independent review not claimed."
  ],
  "nextHypothesis": "Add an explicit ACR derivation rule (short uppercase prefix such as NOR, matching ^[A-Z][A-Z0-9]*-REQ-[0-9]+$) to requirement-entry-format.xml and repeat it in the MODULE_REQUIREMENTS skeleton comment. Test: a module-flat fixture should then pass with one Write and one `sdd-check --authoring` call, eliminating the observed rewrite/warning cycle."
